    "preamble": "Sajeer K.M vs K P A Store on 26 August, 2016 Author: B.Sudheendra Kumar Bench: B.Sudheendra Kumar In The High Court Of Kerala At Ernakulam Present: The Honourable Mr. Justice B.Sudheendra Kumar Friday, The 26Th Day Of August 2016/4Th Bhadra, 1938 Crl.Rev.Pet.No. 1474 of 2013 () -------------------------------- Cc 222/2009 of J.M.F.C.-Ii, Kannur Revision Petitioneraccused No.1 & 2: --------------------------------------------------- 1. Sajeer K.M., Aged 27 Years S/O. Sathar, K.M.House, Chirakkal, Kannur District. 2. A.P.Sadhuli , Aged 38 Years S/O. Ismayil, \"Nissa Manzil\", Valapattanam, Kannur District. By Advs.Sri.K.C.Santhoshkumar Smt.K.K.Chandralekha Respondents/Accused No.3/Complainant And State : ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 1. K P A Store Cw 35/646, Hajee Road, Kannur-1. 2. The Food Inspector Kannur. 3. State Of Kerala Represented By The Public Prosecutor, High Court Of Kerala, Ernakulam. R1 By Adv. Sri.C.K.Sreejith R1 By Adv. Sri.Jimmy Varghese R2 & 3 By Public Prosecutor, Smt.Jasmine V.H Sajeer K.M vs K P A Store on 26 August, 2016 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/173994595/ 1 This Criminal Revision Petition Having Been Finally Heard On 26-08-2016, The Court On The Same Day Passed The Following: B.Sudheendra Kumar, J. - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -- - - -- - - - - - - - - - -- - - - - - - - - Crl.R.P. No.1474 of 2013 - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - Dated this the 26th day of August 2016 O R D E R",
